# Config Rules

## Tailwind
- Never add new colors not already in the brand system
- Never add new font families without asking first
- Brand tokens are the source of truth — never override with arbitrary values
- Animation keyframes must be added to tailwind.config.ts not inline styles

## Translations
- src/locales/en.json and ar.json are the source of truth for all copy
- Never hardcode translatable strings in components
- Keep translation keys consistent between en and ar files
- Use nested keys: page.section.element

## Config
- All site-wide config lives in src/lib/config.ts
- Never hardcode phone numbers, emails, social handles in components
- Reference config values instead